{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110573","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110573/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110573/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110573/events","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/110573","id":3422413490,"node_id":"I_kwDOAO6SJc7L_eKy","number":110573,"title":"Statically typed signal parameters are treated as if they never had static typing","user":{"login":"tomsterBG","id":117642342,"node_id":"U_kgDOBwMUZg","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/117642342?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/tomsterBG","html_url":"https://github.com/tomsterBG","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tomsterBG/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tomsterBG/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tomsterBG/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tomsterBG/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tomsterBG/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tomsterBG/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tomsterBG/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tomsterBG/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tomsterBG/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":73330068,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2OA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/feature%20proposal","name":"feature proposal","color":"4466ff","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279096997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTY5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/archived","name":"archived","color":"aaaaaa","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279097966,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTc5NjY=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:core","name":"topic:core","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098082,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgwODI=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:gdscript","name":"topic:gdscript","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":4,"created_at":"2025-09-16T13:54:26Z","updated_at":"2025-12-16T13:32:22Z","closed_at":"2025-09-16T16:23:41Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n- Reproducible in 4.5 and 4.4.1\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.5.stable - Linux Mint 22.2 (Zara) on X11 - X11 display driver, Multi-window, 1 monitor - Vulkan (Forward+) - integrated AMD Radeon Graphics (RADV RENOIR) - AMD Ryzen 5 5500U with Radeon Graphics (12 threads) - 7.11 GiB memory\n\n### Issue description\n\nI can statically type the parameters of a signal, but this is being ignored:\n\n<img width=\"429\" height=\"307\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/d8245f61-9c4a-4284-8eab-2595e1ae9344\" />\n\nI went further:\n\n<img width=\"566\" height=\"640\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/c5366bec-3422-416f-b70e-e30f183ce0a5\" />\n\n<img width=\"680\" height=\"263\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/9c52938b-a2cf-4474-b6e2-99928943d119\" />\n\n<img width=\"1335\" height=\"456\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/967a14b8-6dcf-4917-a40c-8eb1ac503e4c\" />\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nUse this script:\n```gdscript\nextends Node\n\n\nsignal my_signal(value: int)\n\n\nfunc _on_my_signal(value):\n\tprint(get_stack()[0].function + \": \" + str(value))\n\nfunc _on_my_signal_typed_wrong(value: Vector2):\n\tprint(get_stack()[0].function + \": \" + str(value))\n\nfunc _on_my_signal_typed(value: int):\n\tprint(get_stack()[0].function + \": \" + str(value))\n\n\nfunc _ready() -> void:\n\tmy_signal.connect(_on_my_signal)\n\tmy_signal.emit(\"hello my signal\")\n\tmy_signal.connect(_on_my_signal_typed_wrong)\n\tmy_signal.emit(Vector2(4, INF))\n\tmy_signal.connect(_on_my_signal_typed)\n\tmy_signal.emit(Color.WHEAT)\n\tmy_signal.emit(69)\n\n```\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nJust a Node in a scene with the above script.","closed_by":{"login":"dalexeev","id":47700418,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3NzAwNDE4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/47700418?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev","html_url":"https://github.com/dalexeev","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110573/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110